ampMode].\n \t\t\t[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change is not proportional and differs from case to case.\n \t\t</member>\n+\t\t<member name=\"physics/2d/kinematic_body_initial_teleport\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\" default=\"false\">\n+\t\t\tif [code]true[/code], the first time the transform is set on a 2D physics body after the body's mode is set to [constant PhysicsServer2D.BODY_MODE_KINEMATIC] it will teleport to the new transform, keeping its velocity and ignoring other bodies in its path. This is the default behavior for Godot versions before 4.6.","path":"doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml","commit_id":"7ee8bc348c7f02b0c8a7fe637dca331ff8190ebd","original_commit_id":"7ee8bc348c7f02b0c8a7fe637dca331ff8190ebd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_eve